window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Freedom never tasted so bitter.</b></p> <p><i>This is the final instalment in the Darkmore Penitentiary series.</i></p> <p><i>Full blurb coming soon!</i></p> <p><i>This series is set in the world of Solaria five years after Zodiac Academy and ten years after Dark Fae and book one was previously published as Darkmore Penitentiary. There is some character crossover but all series can be listened to independent of each other without spoilers. The female lead will end up with more than one love interest.</i></p>"; 
